### Inscription
POST http://localhost:5140/api/auth/register
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "test@example.com",
  "password": "Motdepasse1",
  "displayName": "Test"
}

### Inscription avec un mot de passe trop court → 400 attendu
POST http://localhost:5140/api/auth/register
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "court@example.com",
  "password": "abc",
  "displayName": "Court"
}

### Connexion
POST http://localhost:5140/api/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{ "email": "test@example.com", "password": "Motdepasse1" }

> {%
    client.global.set("accessToken", response.body.accessToken);
%}

### Qui suis-je ? (200 attendu)
GET http://localhost:5140/api/auth/me
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}

### Sans token (401 attendu)
GET http://localhost:5140/api/auth/me

### Mauvais mot de passe (401 attendu)
POST http://localhost:5140/api/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{ "email": "test@example.com", "password": "mauvais" }